{"seq":3,"slug":"photo-imaging-sensing","title":"光电与成像传感","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/sensing/photo-imaging-sensing","wordCount":1809,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"光电与成像传感\">光电与成像传感</h1><p>光是信息密度最高的物理量：一颗几毫米见方的图像芯片，每秒能产生上千万个像素的强度与色彩数据，让机器「看见」世界。从条码扫描里的单点光电二极管，到手机里的亿级像素 CMOS，再到自动驾驶的飞行时间深度相机，光电传感自成一个不同于<a href=\"physical-quantity-sensing\">物理量传感</a>的体系——它们都源自同一个量子机制：光子打进半导体，激发出可被读出的电荷。这一篇拆解从单点探测到面阵成像、再到深度感知的完整谱系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>所有半导体光电器件的共同基础是<strong>光生伏特/光电导效应</strong>：能量大于禁带宽度的光子被吸收后，在半导体内激发电子-空穴对。如何收集与读出这些载流子，把器件分成探测型与成像型两大族。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  L[入射光子] --&gt; Q[激发电子-空穴对]&#10;  Q --&gt; S{读出结构}&#10;  S --&gt;|单点/少点| D[光电二极管&lt;br/&gt;光电导/雪崩 APD&lt;br/&gt;SPAD 单光子]&#10;  S --&gt;|面阵成像| I[CCD 电荷耦合&lt;br/&gt;CMOS 有源像素]&#10;  D --&gt; U1[光强/脉冲计数]&#10;  I --&gt; U2[图像帧]&#10;  U2 --&gt; ISP[图像信号处理 ISP]&#10;  D --&gt; TOF[飞行时间 测距]&#10;  ISP --&gt; OUT[数字图像输出]\">graph TD\n  L[入射光子] --&gt; Q[激发电子-空穴对]\n  Q --&gt; S{读出结构}\n  S --&gt;|单点/少点| D[光电二极管&lt;br/&gt;光电导/雪崩 APD&lt;br/&gt;SPAD 单光子]\n  S --&gt;|面阵成像| I[CCD 电荷耦合&lt;br/&gt;CMOS 有源像素]\n  D --&gt; U1[光强/脉冲计数]\n  I --&gt; U2[图像帧]\n  U2 --&gt; ISP[图像信号处理 ISP]\n  D --&gt; TOF[飞行时间 测距]\n  ISP --&gt; OUT[数字图像输出]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>器件</th>\n<th>机理</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>强项</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>光电二极管</td>\n<td>反偏 PN 结光电流</td>\n<td>电流</td>\n<td>线性、快速</td>\n<td>光通信、测光</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>雪崩二极管 APD</td>\n<td>雪崩倍增</td>\n<td>放大电流</td>\n<td>高灵敏</td>\n<td>激光雷达接收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SPAD</td>\n<td>盖革模式单光子</td>\n<td>数字脉冲</td>\n<td>单光子计数</td>\n<td>dToF、量子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CCD</td>\n<td>电荷逐级转移</td>\n<td>模拟电荷</td>\n<td>低噪声、高一致</td>\n<td>科学成像</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CMOS</td>\n<td>像素内放大</td>\n<td>数字</td>\n<td>低功耗、集成</td>\n<td>手机、车载</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"从光子到电流-探测型器件\">从光子到电流：探测型器件</h2><p>最基础的光电器件是<strong>光电二极管（photodiode）</strong>。在反向偏置下，耗尽区吸收光子产生的载流子被电场扫出，形成与入射光功率成正比的光电流，线性度极好，是测光、光通信接收的主力。其关键指标是响应度（A/W）、暗电流（无光时的漏流，决定弱光下限）与响应速度（受结电容与负载电阻的 RC 限制）。</p>\n<p>当光极弱时，需要内部增益。<strong>雪崩光电二极管（APD）</strong> 在高反偏下让载流子碰撞电离产生雪崩倍增，提供数十倍内增益，是激光雷达接收端的常客。把偏压再推过击穿点进入盖革模式，就得到<strong>单光子雪崩二极管（SPAD）</strong>：一个光子即可触发一次可数字化的雪崩脉冲，实现单光子级灵敏度。SPAD 阵列配合皮秒级计时电路，构成直接飞行时间（dToF）激光雷达与手机的距离传感器——这正是把光电探测推向极限的方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成像阵列-ccd-与-cmos-的世纪之争\">成像阵列：CCD 与 CMOS 的世纪之争</h2><p>把光电探测单元排成二维阵列就得到图像传感器。两条技术路线长期并存。<strong>CCD（电荷耦合器件）</strong> 把每个像素积累的电荷像「水桶接力」一样逐级移位到统一的读出放大器再数字化，因此像素一致性极好、噪声极低，曾是科学与天文成像的金标准；代价是工艺特殊、功耗高、读出慢、难以片上集成。</p>\n<p><strong>CMOS 图像传感器（CIS）</strong> 则在每个像素内置放大晶体管（有源像素传感器，APS），可逐行/逐列随机读出，能与逻辑、<a href=\"../interface/adc-sampling\">ADC</a>、甚至 AI 加速器同片集成，功耗低、速度快。早期 CMOS 噪声与一致性逊于 CCD，但<strong>背照式（BSI）</strong> 与<strong>堆叠式（stacked）</strong> 工艺把光电二极管移到布线层之上、并把像素层与处理层垂直堆叠后，CMOS 在灵敏度与速度上全面反超。据行业数据，2026 年 CMOS 在图像传感市场约占 60% 份额，已是绝对主流（<a href=\"https://www.mordorintelligence.com/industry-reports/mems-sensor-market\">来源</a>）。这些堆叠结构的制造与 <a href=\"../systems/mems-microsystems\">MEMS 微系统</a>的三维集成思路一脉相承。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>CCD</th>\n<th>CMOS（BSI/堆叠）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>读出方式</td>\n<td>电荷转移到统一放大器</td>\n<td>像素内放大、行列寻址</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>噪声/一致性</td>\n<td>极佳</td>\n<td>已接近并在速度上反超</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功耗</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>片上集成</td>\n<td>困难</td>\n<td>ADC/逻辑/AI 同片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>当前地位</td>\n<td>退守科学/天文</td>\n<td>消费与车载主流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"衡量成像质量与彩色重建\">衡量成像质量与彩色重建</h2><p>评价图像传感器要回到<a href=\"sensor-classification\">传感器分类与特性</a>的指标语言，但有专属维度。<strong>量子效率（QE）</strong> 是入射光子转成可收集电子的比例。<strong>动态范围</strong> 是最亮不饱和与最暗可分辨之间的比值，受满阱容量与读出噪声共同决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>full well</mtext></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>read noise</mtext></msub></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DR} = 20\\log_{10}\\frac{N_\\text{full well}}{N_\\text{read noise}}\\ (\\mathrm{dB})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">read noise</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">full well</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">dB</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>信噪比</strong> 在中高光照下由光子散粒噪声主导，遵循泊松统计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>SNR</mtext><mo>≈</mo><msqrt><mi>N</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SNR} \\approx \\sqrt{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SNR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1133em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，即信号越强信噪比越高。</p>\n<p>彩色成像还需把单色像素变成 RGB。主流做法是在像素上覆盖<strong>拜耳滤色阵列（Bayer）</strong>，每个像素只感一种颜色，再由图像信号处理器（ISP）通过去马赛克插值出全彩——这一步以及降噪、白平衡、HDR 合成，是把原始电荷数据变成可看图像的关键软件链。车载与机器视觉还会在传感器后直接接边缘 AI，把成像与感知合一，这部分系统级整合见<a href=\"../systems/iot-smart-sensing\">物联网与智能传感</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"深度感知-从二维图像到三维场景\">深度感知：从二维图像到三维场景</h2><p>机器要在真实世界里行动，光有平面图像还不够，必须知道每个像素有多远。三类主流深度感知方法各有取舍。<strong>立体视觉</strong> 用两台标定好的相机，靠同一物点在左右图像里的视差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 反推距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z = f\\cdot B / d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 焦距、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 基线），纯被动、成本低，但在无纹理表面失效、计算量大。<strong>结构光</strong> 主动投射已知图案（散斑或条纹），靠图案在物体上的形变解算深度，近距离精度高（人脸识别就靠它），但室外强光下投射图案被淹没。<strong>飞行时间（ToF）</strong> 直接测光往返时间，间接 iToF 测调制光相位、直接 dToF 用前述 SPAD 测单光子脉冲到达时刻——dToF 正是车载激光雷达与高端手机测距的方向。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>强项</th>\n<th>短板</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>立体视觉</td>\n<td>双目视差</td>\n<td>被动、廉价</td>\n<td>无纹理失效、算力大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构光</td>\n<td>投射图案形变</td>\n<td>近距高精度</td>\n<td>怕强光、需投射器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dToF/iToF</td>\n<td>光飞行时间</td>\n<td>远距、直接出深度</td>\n<td>多径、功耗</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这三类深度数据常与彩色图像一起送进<a href=\"../systems/sensor-fusion\">传感器融合</a>，构成机器人与自动驾驶的三维环境模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>一切光电器件源自同一量子机制：光子激发电子-空穴对；区别在收集与读出结构。</li>\n<li>探测型谱系按灵敏度递进：光电二极管（线性测光）→ APD（雪崩增益）→ SPAD（单光子计数，dToF/激光雷达）。</li>\n<li>成像两路线：CCD 噪声低一致性好但难集成，CMOS 靠背照与堆叠工艺在 2026 年以约 60% 份额成为绝对主流。</li>\n<li>成像质量看量子效率、动态范围、散粒噪声主导的信噪比；彩色靠拜耳阵列 + ISP 去马赛克重建。</li>\n<li>光电传感与<a href=\"physical-quantity-sensing\">物理量传感</a>并列构成传感原理两大体系，向下接<a href=\"../interface/adc-sampling\">ADC</a>与系统级<a href=\"../systems/iot-smart-sensing\">智能传感</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"光电与成像传感","id":"光电与成像传感"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从光子到电流：探测型器件","id":"从光子到电流-探测型器件"},{"level":2,"text":"成像阵列：CCD 与 CMOS 的世纪之争","id":"成像阵列-ccd-与-cmos-的世纪之争"},{"level":2,"text":"衡量成像质量与彩色重建","id":"衡量成像质量与彩色重建"},{"level":2,"text":"深度感知：从二维图像到三维场景","id":"深度感知-从二维图像到三维场景"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"物理量传感","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/sensing/physical-quantity-sensing"},"next":{"title":"信号调理电路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/interface/signal-conditioning"}}